SetBreaker_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the admin
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the admin
    ├── when the window is under 60 seconds or over 1 day
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the window is 60 seconds to 1 day
        ├── it should store the limit and the window
        ├── it should leave the counters, the window start and a trip alone
        └── it should emit {CircuitBreakerUpdated}
